    "created_at": "2020-06-22T19:32:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-22T19:32:02Z",
    "body": "Hmm. I guess maybe you haven't seen definitions of that sort before, so we could try to make it clearer if that would help you. But it's just saying that text is unconstrained by default, and that there are constraints put on it by specific call sites.",
